@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Token de prueba para ana
# @name tokenAna
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "ana"}

### Token de prueba para beto
# @name tokenBeto
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "beto"}

###
@ana = {{tokenAna.response.body.access_token}}
@beto = {{tokenBeto.response.body.access_token}}

### Ana abre una cuenta en quetzales con saldo inicial
# @name cuentaAna
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currency": "GTQ", "initial_balance": "20000.00"}

### Beto abre una cuenta en quetzales
# @name cuentaBeto
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{beto}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currency": "GTQ"}

###
@cuentaAna = {{cuentaAna.response.body.number}}
@cuentaBeto = {{cuentaBeto.response.body.number}}

### Mis cuentas
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{ana}}

### Saldo
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{cuentaAna}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ana}}

### Beto no puede ver la cuenta de Ana (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{cuentaAna}}
Authorization: Bearer {{beto}}

### Transferencia (repetir este request devuelve la misma respuesta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pago-001

{"from_account": "{{cuentaAna}}", "to_account": "{{cuentaBeto}}", "amount": "250.00"}

### Misma llave con otro monto (422 idempotency_key_reused)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pago-001

{"from_account": "{{cuentaAna}}", "to_account": "{{cuentaBeto}}", "amount": "300.00"}

### Mayor a Q5,000: se valida con el core (puede tardar hasta 3.5 s)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pago-002

{"from_account": "{{cuentaAna}}", "to_account": "{{cuentaBeto}}", "amount": "5500.00"}

### Saldo insuficiente (422 saldo_insuficiente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pago-003

{"from_account": "{{cuentaAna}}", "to_account": "{{cuentaBeto}}", "amount": "999999.00"}

### Bloquear
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{cuentaBeto}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{beto}}

### Transferir a una cuenta bloqueada (422 cuenta_bloqueada)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{ana}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pago-004

{"from_account": "{{cuentaAna}}", "to_account": "{{cuentaBeto}}", "amount": "10.00"}

### Desbloquear
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{cuentaBeto}}/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{beto}}

### Estado de cuenta
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{cuentaAna}}/statement?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ana}}

### Salud
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Metricas
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
